# Mitigation stack applied here: FP16 KV cache + --spec-draft-n-max 3
# (validated stable at n_max=2 first; bumped to 3 for throughput).
# If unstable, walk back to n_max=2, then drop --kv-unified, then drop
# --cache-reuse, then disable MTP entirely. See gremlins doc for the full
# ladder.
# See: gremlins/02_QWEN36-27B-MTP-CUDA-CRASH.md
#      https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/40756
#      https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp/issues/23322
#      https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp/issues/23264
